	"Description": "This mod adds a working Boomerang to the game. You can buy one at the Adventurer's Guild at any time.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Controls:[/b] \n<br />Left-click to swing the boomerang, right-click to throw it at the mouse position. The boomerang will return to you after reaching its target.\u00A0\n<br />You (obviously) cannot swing the boomerang while it is airborne but you can switch to another weapon for attacking. There is a short cooldown before you can throw again.\n<br />\n<br />[b]Update: [/b]The mod now has controller support. Use the equivalent controller buttons to swing / throw.\n<br />\n<br />Code is available [url=https://github.com/arannya/BoomerangMod]here[/url]\uFEFF.",
